        "id": "textbook-intro",
        "moduleId": "situation-and-goal",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材导引：Canny 是什么、本节学什么",
        "markdown": "本节的主题是 Canny 边缘检测（Canny Edge Detection），一种常用的边缘检测算法，由 John F. Canny 于 1986 年提出。它是一个多阶段算法，教材将逐一走过每个阶段。本节的学习目标有两项：理解 Canny 边缘检测的概念，以及掌握 OpenCV 中对应的函数 `cv.Canny()`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000060"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
